Package: rsage
Title: Result Objects for R Sage Analysis Modules
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R Sage contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@rsage.dev")
Description: The shared runtime of R Sage analysis modules. Modules build
    their output with rs_table(), rs_plot() and rs_note(); the same result
    object prints in the console, renders in Quarto documents through
    knit_print(), and is written as result.json for the R Sage analysis tab.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: jsonlite, ggplot2, knitr, tools, utils, stats, grDevices
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
